00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:14,870
it has to be a culture, or at least in part a culture, right? and it's really a culture of collaboration.

441
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:19,510
and you know, we're going to get to a point where we're adding all types of letters to the devops, right?

442
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:23,990
we've got devsecops, devsec phenops, devsec finn, marketing ops, right?

443
00:29:23,990 --> 00:29:28,230
in reality, what we're really talking about is collaboration and cooperation, right?

