00:38:29,119 --> 00:38:31,990
but it may be nothing.

590
00:38:31,990 --> 00:38:35,030
so for me, i try to say like, hey, when an alert fires.

591
00:38:35,030 --> 00:38:36,710
let's be sure that it that it's a real thing.

592
00:38:36,720 --> 00:38:40,470
and in conjunction with that, when it fires.

593
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:46,870
how do we make sure that we're giving the engineer that gets paige some context.

