00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:16,470
what i think you're calling attention to is.

621
00:40:16,470 --> 00:40:21,431
if you create a lot of fatigue among your people whose job is to keep. the system up and running.

622
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:24,950
and that impairs their ability to do their work.

623
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:32,870
or they are spending a lot of time, which is also valuable to the business, doing nothing.

