00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,309
is that a fair statement?

626
00:40:36,309 --> 00:40:38,309
that is extremely accurate.

627
00:40:38,309 --> 00:40:43,109
and you know, i feel that a lot of companies sort of discount these soft costs, right?

